{'symbol': 'TYL', 'date': '2022-11-15 09:17:00', 'title': 'TYLER TECHNOLOGIES SIGNS $54 MILLION AGREEMENT WITH THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF STATE', 'text': "PLANO, TEXAS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TYLER TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: TYL) ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A FIVE-YEAR, $54 MILLION AGREEMENT WITH THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF STATE'S DIPLOMATIC SECURITY SERVICE (DSS) FOR TYLER'S CASE MANAGEMENT DEVELOPMENT PLATFORM – THE LARGEST-EVER AWARD FOR SUCH A SYSTEM."}